OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackle huge recycling
OL,4,Acentre blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents are being urged to keep their
OL,7,Fwindows and doors shut due to smoke
OL,8,Fcoming from a large fire at a recycling
OL,9,Fplant in Worcestershire.
OL,11,FAbout 30 firefighters are tackling the
OL,12,Fblaze at Total Metal Recovery Ltd in
OL,13,FStoke Prior, near Bromsgrove.
OL,15,FA large plume of black smoke was
OL,16,Freported from witnesses coming from the
OL,17,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
