OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackle huge recycling
OL,4,Acentre blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrews were first alerted to the fire at
OL,7,F05:00 BST on Tuesday and station
OL,8,Fcommander Craig Newman said the B4091
OL,9,Fthat runs past the site had been
OL,10,Fclosed.
